# Derived data: ~4-5 GB of 16 kHz WAV clips plus the TSVs that index them.
# Rebuild any time with:
#     python3 data/scripts/download_extra_speech.py
#
# The repo root .gitignore already excludes data/speech/ for exactly this
# reason, but it predates this directory and does not cover it. Rather than
# reach outside this tree to edit it, the same job is done here -- Git honours
# .gitignore files in subdirectories, so a stray `git add -A` cannot stage
# gigabytes of audio.
#
# train.tsv is ignored too, and deliberately: the aggregate at the top of this
# directory holds ABSOLUTE paths, which are meaningless on any other machine.
*
!.gitignore
